s, weights, wearable receipts, detailed quests/achievements and session-start records are omitted; see the complete ERD." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=15;align=left;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1065" width="1520" height="80" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>